# Only runtime files enter the build context; never send credentials or logs.
**
# Contract: every runtime COPY source is re-included with `!` below.
# tests/test_deployment.py parses this file against the Dockerfile.
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!requirements.txt
!VERSION
!converter.py
!app/*.py
!app/adapters/*.py
# The console builds inside the image, so its whole source tree is needed: the
# frontend stage runs check, unit tests and build against web/ before packaging.
!web/**
# Re-exclude what the frontend stage regenerates, so the context stays small.
# Last matching pattern wins, so these must follow the `!web/**` allowlist above.
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/.tmp-*